Don't trade any digitally fritched versions of this. If you feel the need to tamper with the work I did for a month and a half perfecting the tweaks I did to make this sound like it does, then go ahead, but don't re-distribute your version of it. I think mine is fine...This is really what I think I heard that day exactly as I remember it.\par
